# Morde Enterprise Operations Portal - Free Vision Model Options

# OPTION 1: Google AI Studio Gemini Free Tier (100% Free, 1,500 requests/day, 15 req/min)
# Get a free key at: https://aistudio.google.com/
# GEMINI_API_KEY=AIzaSy...
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-2.0-flash

# OPTION 2: OpenRouter Free Models (100% Free)
# Models available at $0.00:
# - openrouter/free (auto-routes to best active free vision model)
# - qwen/qwen-2.5-vl-72b-instruct:free
# - meta-llama/llama-3.2-11b-vision-instruct:free
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-v1-...
# OCR_MODEL_NAME=openrouter/free

# Worker OCR uses google/gemini-3.8-flash through OpenRouter only.
# QA and voucher OCR continue to use OCR_PROVIDER / OCR_MODEL_NAME routing.

# Store original document scans outside the web root on a durable private volume.
# MORDE_PRIVATE_UPLOAD_DIR=/secure/private/morde-documents
